    },
    {
      "finding": "Live page scrape shows the playable UI: Items 0 counter, Discoveries panel, sort-by-time control, trash, clear-canvas, dark-mode, sound, recipes, logo and menu icons, and clear-all confirmation",
      "url": "https://neal.fun/infinite-craft/"
    },
    {
      "finding": "Gameplay layout has infinite workspace on the left and element list with Discoveries and sorting menu on the right; player clicks and drags elements from the right onto the canvas to combine them",
      "url": "https://www.ign.com/wikis/infinite-craft/How_to_Play_Infinite_Craft"
    },
    {
      "finding": "Start with Water, Fire, Wind and Earth; drag from menu into play area; Water plus Fire makes Steam; combining same item with itself works, e.g. Earth plus Earth makes Mountain; Reset wipes discoveries while broom clears only the workspace",
      "url": "https://dotesports.com/general/news/how-to-play-infinite-craft-from-neal-fun"
    },
    {
      "finding": "Uses Llama 2 and Llama 3.1 to create new elements and emojis; unseen pairs go to generative AI then saved to database so the same pair always outputs the same result; first finder gets First Discovery label; no defined goal",
      "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Infinite_Craft"
    },
    {
      "finding": "Official app description: endless crafting from neal.fun, start with Water, Fire, Earth and Wind, over 100 million combinations, be first to discover new items",
      "url": "https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=fun.neal.infinite.craft&hl=en"
    },
    {
      "finding": "Mouse control: all you need is a working mouse to click and drag elements; combining is done by dropping one element on another",
      "url": "https://www.ign.com/wikis/infinite-craft/How_to_Play_Infinite_Craft"
    },
    {
      "finding": "Mobile control: on mobile tap an object then tap a second object to merge them; PC uses click-and-drag workspace",
      "url": "https://infinite-craft.com/"
    },
